                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b3bd6e7f-db20-437a-9aa5-b39b11e8cd70",
                                "sense_id": "6ff9a321-771b-3de1-96df-f734d1bf92f6",
                                "text": "“A long career gap can sometimes make it difficult to re-enter the workforce, especially in areas with rapidly changing technological advancements,” said Stephen Dwyer, president of the ASA. Microretirees may also lose out on retirement contributions and income they would have received had they chosen to stay in the workforce, he added."
